    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Move up to 3 squares without provoking, then let nearby willing allies follow. You and each ally that moves gain 1 Boon to your next defense.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One willing ally within 3 squares who hears you, before an attribute roll penalized by Frightened.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Recovery</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Reduce the ally&#39;s temporary Frightened by 1 before its roll.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785/design/cards/call-their-name.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/call-their-name.md</a> at <code>24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785</code>.</p></section>",
